set_id": "uis001", "dataset_uid": "da_w1k20p", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze", "timeserie"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [{"id": "https_download_uis_unesco_org_bdds_202602_sdg_zip", "title": "https://download.uis.unesco.org/bdds/202602/SDG.zip", "description": "Bulk Data Download\n\nThe archives listed below contain the latest official data disseminated by the UNESCO Institute for Statistics (UIS). This archive is a result of a rigorous data production activity that ensures a high level of data quality. In order to expose the dataset to the largest audience possible and reduce its complexity, the UIS has normalized and compiled it using comma-separated values (CSV) format. This allows both beginners and seasoned data professionals to understand and work with it.", "mimetype": "application/octet-stream", "url": "https://data.unesco.org/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/uis001/alternative_exports/https_download_uis_unesco_org_bdds_202602_sdg_zip"}], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "SDG 4 Education Indicators (Global & Thematic)", "title_en": "SDG 4 Education Indicators (Global & Thematic)", "title_fr": "Indicateurs de l'\u00e9ducation de l'ODD 4 (mondiaux et th\u00e9matiques)", "title_es": "Indicadores de Educaci\u00f3n del ODS 4 (Globales y Tem\u00e1ticos)", "title_ar": "\u0627\u0644\u0647\u062f\u0641 4 \u0645\u0646 \u0623\u0647\u062f\u0627\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0646\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u062f\u0627\u0645\u0629 \u0645\u0624\u0634\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0639\u0644\u064a\u0645 (\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a \u0648\u0645\u0648\u0636\u0648\u0639\u064a)", "description": "<p>Comprehensive set of globally comparable education indicators used to monitor <strong data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"523\">SDG 4</strong>, compiled from administrative data, household surveys, learning assessments, and partner sources. Covers access, participation, learning outcomes, finance, and equity across 200+ countries.\u00a0<br><br></p><blockquote class=\"\">Data filtered from 2015 currently</blockquote><p><br><a href=\"https://download.uis.unesco.org/bdds/202602/UIS%20-%20Data%20Release%20Background%20Doc%20-EN-Feb%202026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Background Information</a></p>", "description_en": "<p>Comprehensive set of globally comparable education indicators used to monitor <strong data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"523\">SDG 4</strong>, compiled from administrative data, household surveys, learning assessments, and partner sources. Covers access, participation, learning outcomes, finance, and equity across 200+ countries.\u00a0<br><br></p><blockquote class=\"\">Data filtered from 2015 currently</blockquote><p><br><a href=\"https://download.uis.unesco.org/bdds/202602/UIS%20-%20Data%20Release%20Background%20Doc%20-EN-Feb%202026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Background Information</a></p>", "description_fr": "<p>Ensemble complet d\u2019indicateurs \u00e9ducatifs comparables \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9chelle mondiale utilis\u00e9s pour surveiller l\u2019ODD\u202f4, compil\u00e9s \u00e0 partir de donn\u00e9es administratives, d\u2019enqu\u00eates m\u00e9nag\u00e8res, d\u2019\u00e9valuations d\u2019apprentissage et de sources partenaires. Couvre l\u2019acc\u00e8s, la participation, les r\u00e9sultats d\u2019apprentissage, la finance et l\u2019\u00e9quit\u00e9 dans plus de 200 pays.<br><br></p><blockquote class=\"\">Donn\u00e9es filtr\u00e9es depuis 2015 actuellement</blockquote><p><br><a href=\"https://download.uis.unesco.org/bdds/202602/UIS%20-%20Data%20Release%20Background%20Doc%20-EN-Feb%202026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Informations de base</a></p>", "description_es": "<p>Conjunto completo de indicadores educativos comparables a nivel mundial utilizados para monitorear <strong data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"523\">ODS 4</strong>, compilados a partir de datos administrativos, encuestas familiares, evaluaciones de aprendizaje y fuentes de socios. Cubre el acceso, la participaci\u00f3n, los resultados de aprendizaje, las finanzas y la equidad en m\u00e1s de 200 pa\u00edses.\u00a0<br><br></p><blockquote class=\"\">Datos filtrados desde 2015 actualmente</blockquote><p><br><a href=\"https://download.uis.unesco.org/bdds/202602/UIS%20-%20Data%20Release%20Background%20Doc%20-EN-Feb%202026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Informaci\u00f3n de fondo</a></p>", "description_ar": "<p>\u0645\u062c\u0645\u0648\u0639\u0629 \u0634\u0627\u0645\u0644\u0629 \u0645\u0646 \u0645\u0624\u0634\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0639\u0644\u064a\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0628\u0644\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0642\u0627\u0631\u0646\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u0633\u062a\u0648\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u062a\u064f\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0645 \u0644\u0645\u0631\u0627\u0642\u0628\u0629 <strong data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"523\">\u0627\u0644\u0647\u062f\u0641 4</strong>\u060c \u062a\u0645 \u062a\u062c\u0645\u064a\u0639\u0647\u0627 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0625\u062f\u0627\u0631\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0637\u0644\u0627\u0639\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0633\u0631\u060c \u0648\u062a\u0642\u064a\u064a\u0645\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0639\u0644\u0645\u060c \u0648\u0645\u0635\u0627\u062f\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0631\u0643\u0627\u0621. \u062a\u063a\u0637\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0635\u0648\u0644\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0627\u0631\u0643\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0646\u062a\u0627\u0626\u062c \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0639\u0644\u0645\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0645\u0648\u064a\u0644\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0648\u0627\u0629 \u0639\u0628\u0631 \u0623\u0643\u062b\u0631 \u0645\u0646 200 \u062f\u0648\u0644\u0629.<br><br></p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"\">\u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0645\u064f\u0641\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0629 \u0645\u0646 \u0639\u0627\u0645 2015 \u062d\u0627\u0644\u064a\u064b\u0627</blockquote>\n\n<p><br><a href=\"https://do